      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>VNTG-FLIP | The Streetwear Edit</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"app-shell\">\n        <div class=\"dev-console\">\n            <details>\n                <summary>Developer Console</summary>\n                <div class=\"console-body\">\n                    <pre id=\"consolePre\">\nfunction addShirt(size, title) {\n    const display = document.getElementById('cartDisplay');\n    display.textContent = size + \" \" + title;\n}\n                    </pre>\n                </div>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n\n        <header class=\"app-header\">\n            <div class=\"status-bar\">\n                <span>9:41</span>\n                <div class=\"icons\">📶 🔋</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"navbar\">\n                <h1 class=\"brand-logo\">vntg-flip</h1>\n                <div class=\"nav-icons\">\n                    <span>🔍</span>\n                    <span class=\"cart-box\">\n                        🛒\n                        <span id=\"bagCount\" class=\"cart-badge\">0</span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"hero-banner\">\n                <div class=\"hero-overlay\">\n                    <p>THE STREETWEAR EDIT</p>\n                    <h2>VINTAGE GRAILS</h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"selection-card\">\n                <p class=\"card-label\">CURRENTLY ADDING</p>\n                <h2 id=\"cartDisplay\">Please select an item</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"menu-list\">\n              <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <img src=\"images/blue-shirt.jpg\" alt=\"Blue Shirt\">\n                  <div class=\"item-info\">\n                      <h3 id=\"blueShirtTitle\" class=\"item-title\">Washed Indigo Tee</h3>\n                      <p class=\"item-desc\">Sun-faded blue tee with a broken-in feel and clean vintage shop styling.</p>\n                      <p class=\"price\">$35.00</p>\n                      <select id=\"blueShirtSize\" class=\"size-select\">\n                          <option value=\"Small\">Small</option>\n                          <option value=\"Medium\" selected>Medium</option>\n                          <option value=\"Large\">Large</option>\n                      </select>\n                  </div>\n                  <button id=\"blueTeeBtn\" class=\"order-trigger\">+</button>\n              </div>\n          \n              <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <img src=\"images/red-shirt.jpg\" alt=\"Red Shirt\">\n                  <div class=\"item-info\">\n                      <h3 id=\"redShirtTitle\" class=\"item-title\">Cherry Star Tee</h3>\n                      <p class=\"item-desc\">Soft red graphic tee with a playful retro look and polished vintage-boutique vibe.</p>\n                      <p class=\"price\">$28.00</p>\n                      <select id=\"redShirtSize\" class=\"size-select\">\n                          <option value=\"Small\">Small</option>\n                          <option value=\"Medium\" selected>Medium</option>\n                          <option value=\"Large\">Large</option>\n                      </select>\n                  </div>\n                  <button id=\"redTeeBtn\" class=\"order-trigger\">+</button>\n              </div>\n          \n              <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <img src=\"images/blue-jacket.jpg\" alt=\"Blue Jacket\">\n                  <div class=\"item-info\">\n                      <h3 id=\"blueJacketTitle\" class=\"item-title\">Classic Denim Layer</h3>\n                      <p class=\"item-desc\">Mid-wash denim jacket with an easy vintage silhouette and everyday throwback feel.</p>\n                      <p class=\"price\">$55.00</p>\n                      <select id=\"blueJacketSize\" class=\"size-select\">\n                          <option value=\"Small\">Small</option>\n                          <option value=\"Medium\" selected>Medium</option>\n                          <option value=\"Large\">Large</option>\n                      </select>\n                  </div>\n                  <button id=\"blueJacketBtn\" class=\"order-trigger\">+</button>\n              </div>\n          \n              <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <img src=\"images/black-jacket.jpg\" alt=\"Black Jacket\">\n                  <div class=\"item-info\">\n                      <h3 id=\"blackJacketTitle\" class=\"item-title\">Midnight Moto Jacket</h3>\n                      <p class=\"item-desc\">Structured black jacket with bold hardware and a sharp, old-school statement look.</p>\n                      <p class=\"price\">$85.00</p>\n                      <select id=\"blackJacketSize\" class=\"size-select\">\n                          <option value=\"Small\">Small</option>\n                          <option value=\"Medium\" selected>Medium</option>\n                          <option value=\"Large\">Large</option>\n                      </select>\n                  </div>\n                  <button id=\"blackJacketBtn\" class=\"order-trigger\">+</button>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer class=\"bottom-nav\">\n            <span>🏠 Feed</span>\n            <span>🔍 Explore</span>\n            <span>➕ List</span>\n            <span>✉️ Chat</span>\n            <span>👤 Me</span>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"utils.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* --- Global Variables & Reset --- */\n:root {\n    --vntg-red: #FF3B30;\n    --vntg-black: #111111;\n    --vntg-white: #ffffff;\n    --vntg-gray: #f2f2f2;\n    --transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #e5e5e5;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n/* --- App Shell: Fixed Mobile Height/Width --- */\n.app-shell {\n    width: min(100%, 1100px);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: var(--vntg-white);\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); /* Simplified shadow for performance */\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n/* --- Top-Aligned Dev Console --- */\n.dev-console {\n    background: #121212;\n    color: #4ade80;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #222;\n    z-index: 20;\n}\n\nsummary {\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: clamp(9px, 2vw, 11px);\n    color: #666;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.console-body {\n    padding: 12px;\n    font-size: clamp(10px, 2.5vw, 12px);\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n}\n\n.console-body pre {\n    margin: 0;\n    white-space: pre-wrap; \n    word-break: break-word;\n}\n\n/* --- Fixed Header Area --- */\n.app-header {\n    background: white;\n    z-index: 10;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.status-bar {\n    padding: 12px 30px 4px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.navbar {\n    padding: 5px 20px 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--vntg-black);\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n}\n\n.nav-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 15px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n/* --- Scrollable Content Area --- */\n.content {\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; /* Momentum scrolling */\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n\n.content::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n}\n\n.hero-banner {\n    height: clamp(160px, 28vw, 260px);\n    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), transparent), url('images/hero.jpg');\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    left: 20px;\n    color: white;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay p {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);\n    margin: 0;\n    font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n/* --- Selection Display (The Target Card) --- */\n.selection-card {\n    margin: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n    background: var(--vntg-gray);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.card-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n#cartDisplay {\n    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px);\n    margin: 0;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--vntg-black);\n}\n\n/* --- Product List Items --- */\n.menu-item {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 15px 20px;\n    gap: 15px;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f9f9f9;\n}\n\n.menu-item img {\n    width: 85px;\n    height: 85px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    transition: var(--transition);\n    will-change: transform; /* Performance optimization */\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.menu-item:hover img {\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.item-info {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.item-info h3 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.aesthetic-tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #aaa;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.item-desc {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n.price {\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--vntg-black);\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 4px 0 0;\n}\n\n/* Dropdown styling */\n.size-select {\n    margin-top: clamp(4px, 1.5vw, 8px);\n    padding: 7px 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: white;\n    color: var(--vntg-black);\n    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.8vw, 12px);\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: clamp(100px, 15vw, 120px);\n}\n\n/* Interactive Button */\n.order-trigger {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #ddd;\n    background: white;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* Bag/Cart Indicator badge */\n.cart-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: var(--vntg-red);\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    transition: transform 0.1s ease;\n}\n\n/* --- Fixed Footer Nav --- */\n.bottom-nav {\n    padding: 15px 10px 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #bbb;\n    border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n    background: white;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* --- Responsive Breakpoints --- */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .app-shell { width: 100%; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .status-bar { padding: 10px 16px 4px; }\n    .navbar { padding: 5px 16px 10px; }\n    .hero-banner { height: 150px; }\n    .hero-overlay h2 { font-size: 20px; }\n    .menu-item { padding: 12px 16px; gap: 12px; }\n    .menu-item img { width: 65px; height: 65px; }\n    .item-info h3 { font-size: 13px; }\n    .item-desc { font-size: 10px; }\n    .price { font-size: 13px; }\n    .size-select { max-width: 110px; font-size: 11px; }\n    .order-trigger { width: 34px; height: 34px; font-size: 18px; }\n    .selection-card { margin: 14px; padding: 14px; }\n    .bottom-nav { padding: 12px 6px 20px; font-size: 10px; }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "prompt.md",
          "contents": "# Function: add shirt\n\n# What it should do\nUpdate the app so it shows the correct shirt when a shirt button is clicked.\n\n# Inputs\nWhat information should this function take in so it can display different shirts?\n- ________\n- ________\n\n# What stays the same\nWhat part of the output should stay the same each time?\n- ________\n- ________\n\n# What changes\nWhat part of the output should change based on the shirt that was clicked?\n- ________\n- ________",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "const blueTeeBtn = document.getElementById('blueTeeBtn');\nconst redTeeBtn = document.getElementById('redTeeBtn');\nconst blueShirtSize = document.getElementById('blueShirtSize');\nconst redShirtSize = document.getElementById('redShirtSize');\n\n\nblueTeeBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => { \n    addShirt(); \n});\n\nredTeeBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => { \n    addShirt(); \n});\n\nfunction addShirt() {\n    const display = document.getElementById('cartDisplay');\n    display.textContent = \"Large Blue Shirt\";\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "6": {
          "id": "6",
          "name": "utils.js",
          "contents": "let bagCounter = 0;\n\ndocument.addEventListener('click', (event) => {\n    if (!event.target.classList.contains('order-trigger')) return;\n\n    bagCounter++;\n    const badge = document.getElementById('bagCount');\n    badge.textContent = bagCounter;\n\n    // Visual Feedback: Faster scale reset (100ms instead of 200ms)\n    badge.style.transform = \"scale(1.4)\";\n    setTimeout(() => { badge.style.transform = \"scale(1.0)\"; }, 100);\n\n    // Selection card feedback: Faster color swap\n    const displayCard = document.querySelector('.selection-card');\n    displayCard.style.backgroundColor = \"#fff0f0\";\n    setTimeout(() => { \n        displayCard.style.backgroundColor = \"#f2f2f2\"; \n    }, 150); // Reduced from 250ms for a \"snappier\" response\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        },
